      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "Tears? But I'm not crying!"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Your eyes make a little bit of tears all the time. When you blink, your eyelids wipe them across, like a window wiper!",
      "punch": "wiper",
      "board": {
        "type": "flow",
        "title": "Blink wash",
