    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "What else does blinking do?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "It protects your eyes too! Your eyelids snap shut to block dust, and you blink and squint in very bright light.",
      "board": {
        "type": "checklist",
